WEBVTT

00:23.290 --> 00:26.760
Welcome! Step right up!

00:24.360 --> 00:25.750
I'm bored.

00:25.990 --> 00:30.490
My ban's finally lifted, but 
Cecilia's too busy to hang out.

00:27.590 --> 00:30.700
You won't find these anywhere else!

00:31.960 --> 00:33.060
Kramen?

00:33.060 --> 00:34.970
Oh, hey, Yoki.

00:35.320 --> 00:36.620
Off work today?

00:36.620 --> 00:40.720
Yeah, well, since I haven't bought 
an anniversary gift yet...

00:40.720 --> 00:43.040
You still haven't given her anything?

00:43.040 --> 00:45.630
Okay, then! I'll help you out!

00:50.110 --> 00:52.860
Maybe she'd like one of these?

00:53.250 --> 00:55.540
It'll go great with a maid uniform,

00:55.540 --> 00:58.020
and it's right in line with your tastes!

00:58.020 --> 01:00.870
The only thing I'm into 
is the maid uniform!

01:01.090 --> 01:02.740
Nah, you gotta get this.

01:02.740 --> 01:04.510
Like hell I do!

01:04.510 --> 01:06.790
I've already bought what I came here for.

01:06.790 --> 01:08.700
Oh, okay. Sorry, man.

01:10.550 --> 01:13.560
That black full-length 
coat is a chuuni's dream!

01:13.560 --> 01:16.260
And that bat-shaped full-face helmet!

01:16.260 --> 01:18.760
Awesome! It's perfect!

01:19.080 --> 01:20.970
R-Really?

01:20.970 --> 01:22.740
Would you like to try them on?

01:22.740 --> 01:26.220
Of course. I want the 
zig-zaggy sword, too.

01:32.440 --> 01:33.470
Well?

01:33.470 --> 01:36.730
This is indeed the appearance 
my soul has long desired!

01:37.830 --> 01:39.240
Yikes.

01:40.030 --> 01:41.530
Are you serious?

01:41.530 --> 01:43.040
Of course!

01:43.350 --> 01:47.090
Now, Kramen, give me a quest!

01:47.090 --> 01:50.730
I will handle any mission you 
may have in the blink of an eye!

03:30.350 --> 03:33.250
What? Didn't you take today off?

03:33.250 --> 03:35.030
Yeah, but you know.

03:35.490 --> 03:36.110
Is that...

03:36.360 --> 03:38.340
a new shikigami of yours?

03:38.340 --> 03:39.820
Who are you calling a shikigami?!

03:39.820 --> 03:43.570
He's an old acquaintance. I'm giving him 
some pesky quests I've had piling up.

03:44.010 --> 03:47.220
We only have four Rank A quests right now.

03:47.220 --> 03:49.040
Which would you like?

03:49.390 --> 03:50.540
All of them.

03:50.540 --> 03:53.900
What?! Four at one time?!

03:53.900 --> 03:55.700
Sure. Leave them to me.

03:55.700 --> 03:57.890
And, um... what's your name?

03:58.740 --> 04:01.590
The Magic Swordsman of Black Lightning!

04:01.170 --> 04:02.680
THE MAGIC SWORDSMAN OF BLACK LIGHTNING

04:03.300 --> 04:05.750
You heard the man. Sign him up.

04:15.870 --> 04:20.380
You will regret showing 
yourself before me!

04:27.310 --> 04:30.160
That is the power of my magic sword!

04:32.270 --> 04:34.790
The heart of a dragon. All yours.

04:35.180 --> 04:36.770
Thank you so much!

04:37.100 --> 04:39.980
This will save my daughter's life!

04:39.980 --> 04:41.820
He took down a dragon?

04:41.820 --> 04:43.190
Incredible...

04:43.190 --> 04:46.010
He's definitely talented, at least.

04:49.680 --> 04:52.010
Well, this is the last quest.

04:59.000 --> 05:00.070
Holy Bell!

05:11.960 --> 05:13.870
Way to go, boss!

05:14.990 --> 05:16.510
The target is up past here.

05:17.180 --> 05:19.080
Roger dodger!

05:19.080 --> 05:20.750
Dodger!

05:37.470 --> 05:40.190
We'll be taking everything in here.

05:40.190 --> 05:41.620
All of it!

05:41.620 --> 05:44.460
Behave yourself and we won't hurt you.

05:46.730 --> 05:47.580
Who's there?!

05:48.200 --> 05:51.390
I've found you, Phantom Thief Envy!

05:51.390 --> 05:53.080
Hup!

05:53.970 --> 05:57.660
Don't think you can run from the 
Magic Swordsman of Black Lightning.

05:57.990 --> 06:02.380
If you come quietly, you won't 
get hurt. What'll it be?

06:02.680 --> 06:05.570
Wh-Wh-Who the heck is this weirdo?

06:05.570 --> 06:07.380
He's making me embarrassed.

06:07.750 --> 06:10.270
This clown stands in the 
way of our ambition!

06:10.270 --> 06:13.140
Get him, Jealousy, Heartburn!

06:13.140 --> 06:15.720
Just leave this to us!

06:15.720 --> 06:16.890
To us!

06:24.510 --> 06:26.990
And now, it's showtime!

06:29.490 --> 06:31.700
Taste my lightning!

06:42.000 --> 06:43.960
It's all tingly!

06:44.920 --> 06:46.210
Well, I can use magic, too!

06:55.560 --> 06:58.020
You will become rust on my magic sword!

07:01.970 --> 07:05.020
Don't worry. It's blunt-edged.

07:05.330 --> 07:07.700
Th-Thank you.

07:07.700 --> 07:09.030
You're unhurt?

07:09.030 --> 07:13.780
Yes! Now I can deliver these Valentine's 
chocolates to the townspeople!

07:14.250 --> 07:15.780
Valentine's?

07:15.780 --> 07:18.790
They have Valentine's 
Day in this world, too?

07:19.190 --> 07:20.540
What's going on?

07:24.750 --> 07:26.500
Who are you?

07:28.420 --> 07:32.510
I am the Magic Swordsman of Black 
Lightning. No one to be suspicious of.

07:32.510 --> 07:33.960
I knew it.

07:33.960 --> 07:35.010
It's Yoki.

07:35.010 --> 07:38.020
Did you do this?

07:38.020 --> 07:39.790
Don't get the wrong idea.

07:39.790 --> 07:41.550
These three are thieves.

07:41.550 --> 07:45.170
I'll let all of you take 
it from here. Farewell!

07:45.650 --> 07:47.150
Wait!

07:48.380 --> 07:49.580
No need to pursue.

07:50.140 --> 07:52.950
We don't need to pursue 
that guy, apparently.

07:52.950 --> 07:54.700
A-All right.

07:55.110 --> 07:58.920
The people are on the ground are 
Phantom Thief Envy and his buddies,

07:58.920 --> 08:00.570
as the quest described.

08:00.570 --> 08:02.260
Let's take them in right away.

08:02.610 --> 08:03.420
Right.

08:03.670 --> 08:05.880
I'll take a look around the area.

08:07.290 --> 08:11.350
So that's how Raven's 
been communicating, huh?

08:11.350 --> 08:13.880
What was he doing before 
Duke joined the order?

08:15.840 --> 08:18.560
I know you're still here, Captain.

08:18.950 --> 08:20.310
He's so damn sharp!

08:20.310 --> 08:23.740
I don't know how long you've 
been a magic swordsman...

08:23.740 --> 08:25.560
The Magic Swordsman of Black Lightning!

08:25.560 --> 08:28.820
...but you should probably start 
coming back to your senses now.

08:30.820 --> 08:35.280
You get all embarrassed and start 
thrashing around after every rampage.

08:35.280 --> 08:38.530
It's a real headache, you know, Captain.

08:39.820 --> 08:42.810
I thought you'd be more normal
 since you came to the humans' city.

08:42.810 --> 08:44.830
You might want to look in a mirror.

08:44.830 --> 08:45.670
Hmph!

08:46.710 --> 08:49.800
Isn't this all-black 
outfit awesome, though?

09:00.810 --> 09:04.100
I've done it again!

09:05.060 --> 09:07.850
Here's your reward for nabbing 
Envy and his buddies.

09:07.850 --> 09:09.080
Thank ya!

09:09.490 --> 09:11.250
What was up with them, anyway?

09:11.250 --> 09:14.180
They used to be B-Rank adventurers,

09:14.180 --> 09:18.130
but then they found some weird book in 
a dungeon and went off the deep end.

09:18.130 --> 09:19.280
What's that all about?

09:19.500 --> 09:22.180
They said they were going 
to destroy Valentine's Day

09:22.180 --> 09:24.290
and started stealing cacao and chocolate.

09:25.690 --> 09:27.920
I mean, I get how they feel, but...

09:28.610 --> 09:30.380
Begin by melting it over hot water.

09:31.050 --> 09:32.320
Teacher...

09:32.320 --> 09:33.850
Very good.

09:33.850 --> 09:35.200
First hurdle.

09:35.200 --> 09:37.880
Getting the right water 
temperature is crucial.

09:39.970 --> 09:43.760
Miss Sophia, this won't crack.

09:43.760 --> 09:44.430
Oh, my.

09:46.710 --> 09:48.840
Thank you!

09:48.840 --> 09:50.270
Not a problem.

09:54.730 --> 09:57.200
You sure are making a lot.

09:57.200 --> 10:00.700
I'll give them to the kids at the 
orphanage and everyone who's helped me.

10:00.700 --> 10:04.340
You're supposed to give your Valentine's 
Day gift to someone special.

10:04.340 --> 10:05.950
Don't you know anything?

10:14.030 --> 10:15.570
You've awakened, boy?

10:15.570 --> 10:18.130
Today seems to be the day 
they call "Valentine's Day."

10:18.130 --> 10:19.840
Y-Yeah?

10:24.390 --> 10:25.580
Cecilia...

10:30.440 --> 10:32.650
My guardian deity!

10:33.150 --> 10:34.900
They're chocolates with magicite in them!

10:34.900 --> 10:37.030
Th-Thank you.

10:37.030 --> 10:40.530
Here, guardian deity. Open wide.

10:40.530 --> 10:43.030
W-Wait... we aren't alone...

10:45.090 --> 10:46.860
Yes, it's delicious.

10:46.860 --> 10:48.040
Great!

10:54.890 --> 10:55.880
Hey.

10:55.880 --> 10:57.550
What's in the box?

10:57.550 --> 10:58.380
Oh, this?

10:58.380 --> 10:59.890
This is...

11:02.010 --> 11:03.890
I-It's blinding!

11:03.890 --> 11:05.640
That's an insane amount of energy!

11:05.890 --> 11:07.140
That's...

11:09.960 --> 11:11.430
Wait, it's chocolate?!

11:11.430 --> 11:13.650
Today's Valentine's Day, you know.

11:13.650 --> 11:15.900
Sophia made them herself.

11:18.780 --> 11:23.420
The refined sweetness fills my 
mouth! I feel like I'm in heaven!

11:23.420 --> 11:25.910
Yes! My woman is the best in the world!

11:26.570 --> 11:27.910
Lucky...

11:30.760 --> 11:32.920
Just so you know, you can't have any!

11:34.920 --> 11:36.810
I don't want any, damn it!

11:36.810 --> 11:38.670
I hope you explode!

11:38.670 --> 11:40.920
And that's why you're here, huh?

11:41.180 --> 11:43.820
Well, I can't go back to my room.

11:43.820 --> 11:45.180
E-Excuse me.

11:45.180 --> 11:47.680
I'm not interrupting anything, am I?

11:49.500 --> 11:52.560
Oh... um...

11:52.560 --> 11:53.550
Go.

11:53.550 --> 11:54.440
Yes, sir.

11:57.090 --> 11:58.690
Um, Duke...

11:59.140 --> 12:00.690
This is for you.

12:00.690 --> 12:03.200
Are you sure I can have this?

12:03.200 --> 12:04.700
Oh, um...

12:05.040 --> 12:08.700
You've always been there for me at work.

12:08.700 --> 12:10.700
I'm grateful, and I really respect you.

12:11.270 --> 12:14.460
Really? Sorry to put you 
through the trouble.

12:17.430 --> 12:20.630
Feel free to come to me 
for advice again anytime.

12:20.630 --> 12:21.380
I will!

12:22.020 --> 12:23.640
Sorry about that... I...

12:24.720 --> 12:28.280
I hope you explode, too!

12:41.830 --> 12:42.860
Yoki!

12:47.370 --> 12:49.790
Raven... Not you, too...

12:49.790 --> 12:51.750
I hope you explode!

12:54.370 --> 12:59.590
Step right up! We've still 
got chocolates and cakes!

12:54.370 --> 12:58.100
I can't root for anyone's 
romantic endeavors today.

12:59.590 --> 13:01.380
What's that line for?

13:01.380 --> 13:05.180
Drop off chocolates for 
the hero right here!

13:02.030 --> 13:03.550
Hero!

13:05.180 --> 13:06.860
Please hurry!

13:05.850 --> 13:09.390
If you want to give them to him 
personally, the line's over there!

13:09.390 --> 13:11.300
Damn it! What the hell?!

13:11.300 --> 13:13.240
Just how popular can a guy be?!

13:13.240 --> 13:15.090
This world is so unfair!

13:15.090 --> 13:17.270
Oh, if it isn't the civilian.

13:17.270 --> 13:21.270
Oh, hey, Mikana. Are you 
getting in line, too?

13:22.090 --> 13:25.530
I'm not sure. I'm not a 
good cook or anything.

13:25.780 --> 13:27.530
Maybe I should just go home.

13:27.530 --> 13:29.480
Huh? Er, um...

13:30.010 --> 13:31.540
Oh, there you are!

13:31.820 --> 13:32.940
Yuga!

13:32.940 --> 13:36.040
Sorry to keep you waiting. Good 
to see you again too, Yoki!

13:36.040 --> 13:39.790
What are you doing here? 
Everyone's waiting for you.

13:39.790 --> 13:44.050
Yeah, sorry. But I wanted to 
get your chocolates first.

13:46.060 --> 13:47.550
B-But...

13:47.550 --> 13:52.060
they came out weird again this year, 
so they probably aren't any good...

13:52.420 --> 13:54.560
That's fine. I'll take them.

14:00.380 --> 14:02.520
Wh-What the hell?!

14:05.870 --> 14:08.350
See? They're no good, right?

14:08.820 --> 14:10.530
This goes way beyond that!

14:12.450 --> 14:15.040
What're you talking about? They're great!

14:15.750 --> 14:16.920
For real?!

14:17.770 --> 14:22.290
I just don't feel like it's Valentine's Day 
until I've had your chocolates, Mikana.

14:22.290 --> 14:24.050
Hey, isn't that Yuga?

14:27.050 --> 14:29.110
Move it! Eternal Friend!

14:32.300 --> 14:34.060
Welp, I still ended up here.

14:34.060 --> 14:36.360
I'm so pathetic.

14:39.210 --> 14:40.850
My, if it isn't Yoki.

14:40.850 --> 14:42.040
Captain!

14:42.040 --> 14:44.320
If you're looking for 
Cecilia, she went to town.

14:46.490 --> 14:48.320
I see...

14:49.740 --> 14:51.660
Look what I got!

14:51.660 --> 14:53.830
Here's some for you, too.

14:54.360 --> 14:57.830
N-No... I don't want chocolates 
from anyone other than Cecilia...

14:58.080 --> 15:01.330
Oh? Mine aren't good enough for you?

15:01.330 --> 15:03.590
Yay! More for me!

15:04.180 --> 15:05.310
I'll take them.

15:05.310 --> 15:06.550
That's a good boy.

15:06.780 --> 15:07.980
Captain!

15:07.980 --> 15:09.800
Envy has escaped from prison!

15:10.050 --> 15:11.260
What?!

15:13.760 --> 15:15.990
Thank you, Lady Cecilia.

15:20.130 --> 15:21.390
That was...

15:29.440 --> 15:30.410
We speak for all those

15:30.410 --> 15:34.450
who have been alienated by the 
blessings of Valentine's Day!

15:48.100 --> 15:49.130
The chocolates!

15:49.790 --> 15:51.380
How could this be happening?!

15:51.670 --> 15:53.260
Serves you right!

15:53.260 --> 15:56.420
Bring down the hammer on all those who 
are fawned on for their good looks!

15:56.420 --> 15:57.390
Bring it down!

16:05.510 --> 16:06.840
Stop it!

16:07.720 --> 16:10.070
Are you trying to ruin Valentine's Day?!

16:10.070 --> 16:15.290
Shut up! A hot guy like you 
who gets tons of chocolates

16:15.290 --> 16:18.120
has no idea how miserable we feel!

16:18.120 --> 16:19.830
No idea!

16:19.830 --> 16:24.830
That's right! People like you are 
always belittling people like me!

16:26.790 --> 16:27.880
Watch out!

16:32.210 --> 16:33.070
Are you okay?!

16:34.300 --> 16:36.810
They're really making a mess of things.

16:36.810 --> 16:38.770
I'll hold the monster here.

16:38.770 --> 16:41.400
You guys get the townsfolk to safety!

16:46.060 --> 16:48.590
This is the end of Valentine's Day!

16:52.010 --> 16:52.810
Hold it!

16:56.680 --> 16:57.780
Who are you?

16:57.780 --> 17:00.540
Enough of this senseless violence.

17:01.710 --> 17:03.330
Who the hell are you?

17:03.330 --> 17:04.470
Are you?!

17:04.870 --> 17:07.540
I completely understand how you feel.

17:07.770 --> 17:12.550
If my position were slightly different, 
I might be doing what you're doing.

17:12.550 --> 17:15.850
It sounds kind of moving 
if you're barely listening,

17:15.850 --> 17:18.550
but what he's actually 
saying is pretty damn sad.

17:18.770 --> 17:23.390
But flying into a rage because 
you didn't get chocolates

17:23.390 --> 17:24.810
is the height of foolishness!

17:25.100 --> 17:28.060
You look like you're in the 
same boat as us, though!

17:28.060 --> 17:30.320
I bet you haven't gotten any chocolates!

17:31.640 --> 17:32.710
I did.

17:32.710 --> 17:33.780
From who?

17:34.790 --> 17:36.730
My friend's mom.

17:37.640 --> 17:40.330
Wow. Embarrassing.

17:40.670 --> 17:43.080
Doesn't admitting that 
feel meaningless to you?!

17:43.310 --> 17:45.080
It's not meaningless!

18:19.740 --> 18:24.340
It's not as if you're holding out any 
hope for Valentine's Day, either!

18:24.340 --> 18:25.750
I am!

18:26.020 --> 18:28.000
I won't give up on getting chocolates

18:28.220 --> 18:31.020
from the girl I love
until this day is over!

18:34.250 --> 18:36.010
The girl you love?!

18:46.890 --> 18:50.150
See?! You want to get chocolates 
from the one you love, too!

18:51.740 --> 18:55.650
Getting chocolates from someone who 
doesn't matter is just a headache!

18:55.880 --> 18:57.400
It is not!

18:58.700 --> 19:04.410
As long as their heart went into 
that chocolate, it makes me happy!

19:04.410 --> 19:07.430
Liar!

19:11.120 --> 19:12.630
Yoki!

19:12.860 --> 19:14.120
Cecilia!

19:24.760 --> 19:25.640
No!

19:33.580 --> 19:34.600
Wait!

19:35.710 --> 19:37.390
Those are all of our chocolates!

19:37.390 --> 19:41.240
We don't know what'll happen 
if we damage that thing!

19:45.310 --> 19:46.410
Give them back.

19:47.170 --> 19:49.740
Give them back. Give them back!

19:54.420 --> 19:58.420
Give Cecilia's chocolate back!

20:01.550 --> 20:02.520
Oh, no!

20:20.360 --> 20:24.220
You... were a girl all along?

20:25.260 --> 20:26.450
Shut up!

20:26.450 --> 20:29.950
There are girls who hate 
Valentine's Day, too!

20:31.960 --> 20:37.710
I-I don't want chocolates 
from a tomboy like you!

20:37.970 --> 20:39.110
But...

20:40.760 --> 20:46.110
Nobody ever wants my chocolates.

20:46.110 --> 20:48.470
So I... I...

20:54.780 --> 20:56.480
That's not true.

20:57.150 --> 20:57.820
Huh?

21:00.980 --> 21:03.740
You can only say that because you're hot!

21:05.670 --> 21:09.740
I'm happy to get chocolates from anyone 
as long as their heart went into it.

21:12.060 --> 21:13.250
Hero...

21:14.100 --> 21:16.250
Here we go again.

21:16.730 --> 21:19.350
You're getting all the glory in the end?!

21:19.350 --> 21:21.500
This is why I hate hot guys!

21:21.820 --> 21:24.770
Yoki, you did so well.

21:27.930 --> 21:29.130
Oh, right.

21:30.010 --> 21:33.550
Would you... accept this?

21:34.750 --> 21:36.020
Of course!

21:44.330 --> 21:45.730
Thank goodness.

21:45.730 --> 21:48.480
Oh, she gave you some, too?

21:48.480 --> 21:51.030
Those cookies are really good.

21:51.390 --> 21:54.980
What? You guys got the same thing?

21:55.790 --> 22:00.040
WITH MY THANKS FOR EVERYTHING YOU DO

21:56.040 --> 21:58.920
Huh? There's a cake, too.

22:03.080 --> 22:06.800
"With my thanks for everything you do"?

22:07.140 --> 22:11.100
What? No fair! Why did only you get cake?

22:11.480 --> 22:12.160
Huh?

22:12.160 --> 22:13.810
It's one of a kind.

22:15.210 --> 22:16.920
You mean...

22:17.960 --> 22:21.980
Hell yeah!
